{
  "uid": "bank-logs",
  "title": "Bank USAC · Logs",
  "tags": [
    "bank-usac",
    "logs"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "description": "El dashboard de logs que pide §4.1: búsqueda por correlationId y traceId, y navegación de un log a su traza.",
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": {
          "type": "datasource",
          "uid": "grafana"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      },
      {
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "bank-prometheus"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "expr": "max by (namespace, replicaset) (time() - kube_replicaset_created{namespace=~\"$environment\"} < 180)",
        "iconColor": "light-blue",
        "name": "Despliegues",
        "titleFormat": "Despliegue: ReplicaSet nuevo {{replicaset}}",
        "textFormat": "namespace {{namespace}} · sólo un rollout crea un ReplicaSet; un escalado del HPA no",
        "step": "2m"
      },
      {
        "datasource": {
          "type": "datasource",
          "uid": "grafana"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "iconColor": "purple",
        "name": "Releases",
        "target": {
          "limit": 100,
          "matchAny": false,
          "tags": [
            "release"
          ],
          "type": "tags"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "current": {
          "text": "prod",
          "value": "prod"
        },
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "bank-prometheus"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(environment)",
        "includeAll": false,
        "label": "Entorno",
        "name": "environment",
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(environment)",
          "refId": "env"
        },
        "refresh": 1,
        "type": "query"
      },
      {
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "datasource": {
          "type": "loki",
          "uid": "bank-loki"
        },
        "definition": "label_values({deployment_environment=\"$environment\"}, service_name)",
        "includeAll": true,
        "label": "Servicio",
        "multi": true,
        "name": "service",
        "query": {
          "label": "service_name",
          "refId": "LokiVariableQueryEditor-VariableQuery",
          "stream": "{deployment_environment=\"$environment\"}",
          "type": 1
        },
        "refresh": 1,
        "type": "query",
        "description": "Los servicios que tienen logs en este entorno, leídos de Loki. Antes salían de Prometheus, que lista quién emite métricas y no quién escribe logs."
      },
      {
        "current": {
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        },
        "hide": 0,
        "includeAll": true,
        "label": "Nivel",
        "multi": true,
        "name": "level",
        "options": [
          {
            "selected": true,
            "text": "All",
            "value": "$__all"
          },
          {
            "selected": false,
            "text": "error",
            "value": "error"
          },
          {
            "selected": false,
            "text": "warn",
            "value": "warn"
          },
          {
            "selected": false,
            "text": "info",
            "value": "info"
          },
          {
            "selected": false,
            "text": "debug",
            "value": "debug"
          }
        ],
        "query": "error,warn,info,debug",
        "type": "custom"
      },
      {
        "current": {
          "text": ".+",
          "value": ".+"
        },
        "hide": 0,
        "label": "correlationId",
        "name": "correlationId",
        "options": [],
        "query": ".+",
        "type": "textbox"
      },
      {
        "current": {
          "text": ".+",
          "value": ".+"
        },
        "hide": 0,
        "label": "traceId",
        "name": "traceId",
        "options": [],
        "query": ".+",
        "type": "textbox"
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 56,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Cómo buscar",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Rellena **uno** de los dos cuadros: `correlationId` para seguir un flujo de negocio (la Fase 1), `traceId` para seguir una traza técnica. Los dos se dejan vacíos para ver todo. Cada línea tiene el botón **Ver la traza**, que salta a Tempo, y **Ver el flujo completo**, que muestra el mismo `correlationId` en todos los servicios. Los campos están en JSON: `timestamp`, `level`, `serviceName`, `environment`, `version`, `correlationId`, `traceId`, `spanId`."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 57,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Volumen de log por nivel",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "bank-loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "bank-loki"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (level) (count_over_time({service_name=~\"$service\", deployment_environment=\"$environment\"} | level=~\".+\" [1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{level}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 58,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Volumen de log por servicio",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "bank-loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "bank-loki"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (service_name) (count_over_time({service_name=~\"$service\", deployment_environment=\"$environment\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service_name}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 59,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Logs",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "bank-loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 16,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 13
      },
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "showLabels": false,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "prettifyLogMessage": true,
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "bank-loki"
          },
          "expr": "{service_name=~\"$service\", deployment_environment=\"$environment\"} | level=~\"$level\" | correlationId=~\"$correlationId\" | traceId=~\"$traceId\"",
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "range"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Los filtros vacíos no filtran: `=~\"\"` en LogQL no excluye nada cuando el valor es una regex vacía."
    }
  ]
}
